    "description": {
      "value": "At the climax of \"They Watched the Stars,\" the party rescues a group of spirit guides. In so doing, Sakuachi proves worthy of a spirit guide—a Sarkorian god who vows to accompany her to the Crown of the World. Characters who accompany Sakuachi gain access to the following new archetype at the end of this adventure. This bond also changes the powers and nature of the spirit guide; the spirit guide becomes a familiar, and a PC with this archetype uses the spirit guide familiar statistics and abilities described in this archetype, rather than the normal benefits."
    },
